parts.append(section('play','遊戲方法與九宮格操作','Gameplay and pad controls',para('選寫實／彩繪鉛筆及地墊／觸控／鍵盤，用左側全景找鳥，移動右側鏡頭並變焦，按 9 拍攝。0 隻鳥為風景照，恰好 1 隻收進圖鑑；2 隻以上失敗，即使同種也一樣。','Select realistic / pencil art and mat / touch / keyboard input. Find birds in the left panorama, move and zoom the right viewfinder, then press 9. Zero birds gives a landscape photo; exactly one enters the collection; two or more fail, even when the same species.')+'<div class="two"><div>'+pad+'</div><div>'+table([bi('輸入','Input'),bi('動作','Action')],[[k,bi(z,en)] for k,z,en in controls])+'</div></div>'+para('鳥框至少 60% 在鏡內才入鏡；大鳥可用中心在鏡內且佔視野至少 50% 的替代條件。第 1 關拍滿 5 種得到望遠鏡；前一關達鳥種數或連續天數門檻即可解鎖下一關。天數通關不自動發放拍鳥獎勵。','At least 60% of the bird box must be in frame, or the bird center must be in frame while filling at least 50% of the view. Capture five species in level 1 to earn the scope. Clear the preceding level by species count or consecutive-day threshold to unlock the next. Day-based completion does not automatically grant the photography reward.')+para('手機有段 1／2／3／6X（6X 數位），望遠鏡 10／15／20X；無段用 0.25／0.5X 微調。最低倍率以 20 步掃全景，放大後每視野分三步。帶 stay 的鳥觀察夠大才倒數，移開不暫停，離場後 15 秒返回。1／7 先暫存 300 ms，組合切換不先縮放。','Stepped phone zoom: 1 / 2 / 3 / 6X (6X digital); scope: 10 / 15 / 20X. Continuous steps: 0.25 / 0.5X. Minimum zoom scans in 20 steps, higher zoom moves a third of the view. Birds with stay values count down once sufficiently enlarged; looking away does not pause them; they return after 15 seconds. Keys 1 / 7 are buffered for 300 ms so their chord switches without first zooming.')))
