parts.append(section('hardware','外部超聲波設備連接與校正','External ultrasonic connection and calibration',para('BirdView 用麥克風接收各格高頻音訊，沒有 USB Serial／BLE 連線實作。頻率是參考音檔推得的預設值，需要現場校正。22990 Hz 不能用 44.1 kHz 收音，須驗證實際 sampleRate 與 Nyquist 邊界，不能只看要求的 48 kHz。','BirdView receives high-frequency tones through a microphone; USB Serial / BLE connections are not implemented. Defaults come from reference recordings and require field calibration. A 22990 Hz channel cannot use 44.1 kHz capture. Validate actual sample rate and Nyquist bounds rather than only the requested 48 kHz.')+table([bi('格位','Cell'),bi('預設 Hz','Default Hz')],[[k,str(v) if v else bi('無頻道／休息','No channel / rest')] for k,v in freq.items()])+para('getUserMedia → MediaStreamSource → AnalyserNode → 帶內線性功率 → 背景／閾值 → Detector → RX input → press。收音永不接 destination，不回播、不保存原始錄音。要求單聲道 48 kHz，關閉 AGC、降噪、回音消除。FFT 4096、±40 Hz、smoothing 0、每 20 ms 讀取。','getUserMedia → MediaStreamSource → AnalyserNode → band linear power → background / threshold → Detector → RX input → press. Microphone audio never connects to destination and is neither replayed nor saved. Request mono 48 kHz without AGC, noise suppression or echo cancellation. FFT 4096, ±40 Hz, smoothing 0, reads every 20 ms.')+'<ol>'+''.join('<li>'+bi(z,en)+'</li>' for z,en in [('由 localhost／HTTPS 或 Electron 安全協定執行，選地墊、允許麥克風、選正確裝置。','Run over localhost / HTTPS or the Electron secure scheme, choose mat input, allow the microphone and select the device.'),('站在 5 號，等安靜與暖機後做 10 秒背景校正；依序踩 1、2、3、4、6、7、8、9。','Stand at cell 5, wait for quiet and warm-up, calibrate ten seconds, then measure cells 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8 and 9.'),('量測峰值、訊號、串擾、下陷；套用通過的建議，失敗格重踩。閾值是線性功率，預設背景乘 4，不是分貝乘 4。','Measure peak, signal, crosstalk and dips. Apply successful recommendations and retry failed cells. Thresholds use linear power, default background × 4, not dB × 4.'),('先放開才能再觸發：超標確認 40 ms；低於閾值乘 0.6 持續 80 ms 解鎖。衝突不移動，僅剛好 1＋7 切換裝置。','Release before retriggering: 40 ms confirmation above threshold, 80 ms below threshold × 0.6 to arm. Conflicts do not move; exactly 1+7 switches equipment.'),('開局／每關、換麥克風／場地、背景切換、取樣中斷或匯入設定後重新校正。','Recalibrate at startup / before levels, after mic / room changes, page hiding, sample gaps or settings imports.')])+'</ol>'+mermaid_block('detector','偵測器狀態機','Detector state machine')+para('?audiotest 使用 audio-protocol/*.wav 模擬；真機還要測喇叭開啟、音量與距離變化下的漏觸／誤觸。低通只降低干擾，不能代替實測。','?audiotest simulates input with audio-protocol/*.wav. Physical tests must cover speakers enabled, volume and distance changes, missed and false triggers. Low-pass filtering reduces interference but does not replace field testing.')))
credits=table([bi('鳥種／試聽','Species / preview'),bi('作者與授權','Author / license'),bi('來源與處理','Source / processing')],[[bi(e(c['zh']),e(c['en']))+'<br><i>'+e(c['sci'])+'</i><audio controls preload="none" src="'+e(c['file'])+'"></audio>',e(c['author'])+'<br><a href="'+e(c['licenseUrl'])+'">'+e(c['license'])+'</a>','<a href="'+e(c['sourcePage'])+'">'+e(c['title'])+'</a><br>'+bi('截取前 12 秒內，單聲道 32 kHz WAV，12 kHz 雙低通、100 Hz 高通、−23 LUFS 響度與淡入；播放時再低通及淡出。衍生檔沿用原授權。','First up to 12 seconds; mono 32 kHz WAV, cascaded 12 kHz low-pass, 100 Hz high-pass, −23 LUFS and fade-in. Playback adds low-pass and fade-out. Derivatives retain the source license.')] for c in clips])
parts.append(section('calls','開放授權鳥鳴與音景','Openly licensed calls and soundscape',para('錄音是開放授權媒體，不等於軟體原始碼。本次採 Wikimedia Commons 的 CC BY-SA 3.0／4.0，保留作者、來源、授權、變更及原始／衍生檔 SHA-256，未採授權不明或僅限非商業的錄音。','Recordings are open media, rather than software source code. Wikimedia Commons CC BY-SA 3.0 / 4.0 recordings include author, source, license, changes and original / derivative SHA-256. Unclear and noncommercial-only licenses were excluded.')+para('按關卡 species 與 manifest 交集隨機選播，不跨物種冒名。一次一段，結束後留 2.8–8 秒安靜；沿用鳥鳴音量滑桿，靜音／退出立即停止，切關後延遲載入不再起播，失敗回到合成音。這是關卡環境音，不是個別可見鳥的定位提示或台灣亞種鑑定教材。','Random playback uses the intersection of level species and manifest. One clip plays at a time with 2.8–8 seconds of silence after it. Calls use the existing volume slider; muting / exiting stop them, stale loads do not start after switching levels, and failures use synthesis. These are ambience rather than positional cues or a Taiwan-subspecies identification resource.')+credits+para('再散布音檔時帶上 manifest、CREDITS 與授權文字，衍生錄音沿用原 CC BY-SA。原始 .source. 檔保存供追溯。地域、亞種與背景音仍可能不同，可再以同物種、同地區且授權相容的聲音替換。','Redistribute manifest, credits and license texts with the recordings; derivatives retain source CC BY-SA. Original .source. files are preserved. Regional, subspecies and background differences may remain; replace with the same species, preferably region, under compatible licenses.')))
